    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Dive into a world of surprises, where every card flip could be your ticket to victory or trouble.<br><br>The prologue showcases a part of the mysterious forest that changes with every game. Can you master the art of strategic card flipping and uncover the first plot mysteries? Get a taste of a larger adventure that combines tactical thinking, luck, and exploration in this captivating roguelike experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the Prologue:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic Combat: Experience the core gameplay where every decision matters. Learn to choose your cards wisely and plan your attacks carefully.<br></li><li>Roguelike Elements: Discover how collecting scrolls can make you stronger. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Vibrant World: Explore part of the atmospheric forest with beautiful graphics.<br></li><li>Cards: Try out a limited set of cards, giving you a taste of the variety in the full game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>First Story Beats: Meet key characters and uncover the beginning of the mysterious plot that unfolds in the full version.<br></li><li>Replayability: Each playthrough of the prologue offers a unique experience thanks to the changing forest.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Try out gameplay elements that fans of <i>Slay the Spire, Inscryption</i>, and similar card-based roguelikes will find both familiar and fresh.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Dive into a world of surprises, where every card flip could be your ticket to victory or trouble.<br><br>The prologue showcases a part of the mysterious forest that changes with every game. Can you master the art of strategic card flipping and uncover the first plot mysteries? Get a taste of a larger adventure that combines tactical thinking, luck, and exploration in this captivating roguelike experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/98a27955ab826fef2ca4a2731f78428f.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the Prologue:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic Combat: Experience the core gameplay where every decision matters. Learn to choose your cards wisely and plan your attacks carefully.<br></li><li>Roguelike Elements: Discover how collecting scrolls can make you stronger. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/83e27602262c3ddb350b4508cd3674d8.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Vibrant World: Explore part of the atmospheric forest with beautiful graphics.<br></li><li>Cards: Try out a limited set of cards, giving you a taste of the variety in the full game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/d63620f324a10bcfced0a2ef9cd949c9.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>First Story Beats: Meet key characters and uncover the beginning of the mysterious plot that unfolds in the full version.<br></li><li>Replayability: Each playthrough of the prologue offers a unique experience thanks to the changing forest.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.poster.avif?t=1733958715\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.webm?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139190/extras/8ceb8f3f9badcf9dfaa449393c3c7b75.mp4?t=1733958715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Try out gameplay elements that fans of <i>Slay the Spire, Inscryption</i>, and similar card-based roguelikes will find both familiar and fresh.",
